### ===========================
### Variáveis
### ===========================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = Bearer SEU_TOKEN_JWT_AQUI

### ===========================
### Perfil do usuário autenticado
### ===========================

### Obter perfil do usuário autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: {{token}}

### ===========================
### Convites
### ===========================

### Criar convite
POST {{baseUrl}}/invitations
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "convidado@example.com",
  "bethelId": 1
}

### Listar convites
GET {{baseUrl}}/invitations
Authorization: {{token}}

### Buscar convite por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invitations/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Revogar convite
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invitations/1
Authorization: {{token}}
